        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.398,
            0.608,
            0.419
          ],
          "content": "3. Draw a net of a cuboid having sidelengths:"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.827,
            0.364,
            0.927,
            0.416
