        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.49,
            0.55,
            0.508
          ],
          "content": "Let us find out the nets of other solids."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.508,
            0.846,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": "A tetrahedron whose faces are equilateral triangles is called a regular **tetrahedron**."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.556,
            0.845,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": "？ What is a net of a regular tetrahedron? Which of the following are nets of a regular tetrahedron?"
